Z||000006||TRiAD||12-12-2001||09:27 AM||||Within 1 week...many people I know were saying they were sick of hearing it on the news and such...they felt bad and all, but they didn't want to hear about it anymore...they wanted to go on with their lives...<P>If I had the paper and the time, I'd run them a copy of each of these pages and mail it to them anonymously. <P>These are all people who were just going about their day...at work, on a plane...each one had a family, somewhere...each one had a life...hopes and dreams...many had children, some may have been pregnant...<P>Only a few "chose to die" that morning. Some for a "cause", and others for "the" cause...to save others. <P>Wow...sorry. <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Raydar||12-12-2001||10:00 AM||||Thanks for posting this. Really puts it all in perspective. <P>Let's resolve to never forget... <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
