Z||000009||Ken Wittlief||12-12-2001||12:12 PM||||Not to take away anything from the tragity of what happened to these people<P> but to retain our perspective, there are almost 300 million people in the US.<P> with an average life span of 75 years, that means 4 million people die in the US every year<P> or taking into account our population distrubution it might only be 2 million per year this year<P> old age, illness, violence, accidents (esp auto accidents) whatever they reason or cause, when that first holiday or birthday hits with a loved one missing, its very difficult go through.<P> I think its safe to say that more people died this year in the US from auto accidents than died in the WTC.<P> Yes this has been a terrible thing. But as with the other 2 million funerals that have occurred in the US this last year, in the end it really doesnt matter why your loved one is not with you, only that they are no longer with you.<BR> <BR> In your prayers this Christmas, please remember everyone who has an empty chair at the table this year - reach out to whoever you can and help them through their grief.||||reg||11
Z||000010||The Fieromaster||12-12-2001||12:32 PM||||So young, so innocent, so much life left!  Its not fair!  I understand the feeling that they are having... Losing a best friend is hard I couldnt imagine losing a parent or even a son/daughter!<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">        <FONT COLOR="red"><B>"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT></B>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/thefieromastersig.gif">    <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AOL IM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||1
